{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，人物心理的因果关系和段落之间的承接不如Y交代得充分，尤其S03—S06、S08和S13；X有些感受也稍显密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、关键词加亮和话语与感受交替呈现，让人不必停下来读完整段文字，就能抓住每段主线；感受随音乐出现，也更容易把听觉和具体情绪对上，细节明显更丰富。Y的优势是人物为什么犹豫、为什么转念、前后心理如何变化，解释得更充分，故事读起来更连贯。但左侧长句需要投入更多阅读注意力，边听边扫时不如X利落。综合作为音乐视频的屏幕呈现，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c8dedf15-1519-4cc0-bd4b-625f12f41c50", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T153622705906Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:37:30.440708+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1a602c4a3317f36762fee1e8382fd85981d24bc99d5e0d2c6cb3190e7fdf79ca", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment